*Infinite [[Chickful A]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You have to use some mid-range cats like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and its [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|crazed variant]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Legs Cat]], [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs]] Cat or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]]. If you feel like you can't beat the stage before the Kory spawns, bring a Wave Shield like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]]. You can bring some [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel]] cats, but you will also need at least 3 meatshields to protect your army.

